      "statement": "`internal/agent/markers.go` defines `SteerToolJSON = \"steer\"` and `AgentToolJSON = \"agent\"` as raw JSON string literals, and `MarkerName` decodes a stored marker to the bare name so live events and stored rows reach the client identically.",
